      (pull requests). Contributions you send are licensed to the author under the same terms as the Software, and the
      author may use them in any way.
   e. Make and share music with the Software. Songs, recordings and project files you create are yours; this licence
      claims nothing in them.

2. What you may not do without written permission from the author

   a. Publish, distribute, share or host copies of the Software, modified or not, in whole or in part, outside the
