      music with it.
   c. Use the source code, the interface design, the graphics, icons or themes, or substantial parts of them, in
      another program or product.
   d. Remove or change the copyright notices.
   e. Use the name "BrickPad" or its logo for another product, or in a way that suggests the author endorses it.

